  name: Thommy
  defaultMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 76dac593878452b419b1a1afba2cf9cb, type: 2}
  ingredient: 1
  ingredientDislikes: 4
  skillOffer: 6
  skillNeeded: 1
  st01_ingredientText: Hi there! I have many leftover carrots for you, cause I got
    too many from the market.
  st01_ingredientDislikeText: One thing I really dislike is beetroots. I'm not rooting
    for that beet.
  st01_skillOfferText: 'I learned a lot about being a parent through the years. I
    know how to help someone going through tough times. '
  st01_skillNeedText: 'My kid had a fight with her friend in the community group.
    And I don''t have anyone to leave her with while I go to the doctor. '
  st03_soupResultText: Oh wow! This soup is delicious.
  st03_skillOfferText: 'I could help with that! I know my way around with parent-kid
    communication. '
  st03_skillNeedText: I keep thinking about my doctor appointment, and no one will
    be there to look out for my kid.
